courseware/*.pptx
courseware/*.docx
courseware/*.pdf
courseware/assets/
courseware/QA/
courseware/archive/

# R and editor build state
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
renv/library/
renv/staging/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/

# Secrets and credentials anywhere in learner activity trees
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*
